01:38:09.225 --> 01:38:12.856
 If you turn your head
 just right into the wind,

01:38:13.558 --> 01:38:16.427
 you can make that voice
 go down to a whisper.

01:38:18.766 --> 01:38:20.636
 And after a while,

01:38:20.738 --> 01:38:23.335
 you might never hear it
 at all.

